# Changes to these paths need a review from a code owner before they merge
# into main (the "main: reviews and checks" ruleset requires it; the code owner's
# own pull requests need no extra approval).
#
# They cover everything that runs with the signing and App Store Connect
# secrets or decides what ships: workflows, fastlane, the Ruby and Swift
# dependency pins, the XcodeGen project (build settings and build scripts),
# entitlements, and the release scripts. Everything else merges on green CI.
#
# Only org admins (and Dependabot) can push branches to this repository, so
# contributors open pull requests from a fork.

/.github/                @mondominator
/fastlane/               @mondominator
/Gemfile                 @mondominator
/Gemfile.lock            @mondominator
/project.yml             @mondominator
/Package.swift           @mondominator
/Package.resolved        @mondominator
*.xcodeproj/             @mondominator
*.xcconfig               @mondominator
*.entitlements           @mondominator
/scripts/                @mondominator
Makefile                 @mondominator

# Agent and editor config runs on the maintainer's machine (hooks, commands,
# instructions), so it gets the same review as CI.
/CLAUDE.md               @mondominator
/AGENTS.md               @mondominator
/.claude/                @mondominator
/.codex/                 @mondominator
/.githooks/              @mondominator
/.vscode/                @mondominator
